                                    <div class="news__info">
                                        <h3 class="news__title">“无尽之焰”点燃未来，2025届互动媒体设计与技术培养项目（IMDT）毕业展启幕</h3>
                                                                                <div class="news__time"><i class="icon-time"></i>2025.05.15</div>
                                    </div>
                                </a>
                                                            <a class="news__item" href="https://gameinstitute.qq.com/news/detail/304" target="_blank">
                                    <div class="news__figure"><img src="https://tigimg-1252093452.image.myqcloud.com/2025/04/09/ntNuhG4D2OorUsPcOPW7.jpg" alt="腾讯游戏与Unity中国共同推出游戏光照云烘焙解决方案"></div>
