                            </swiper-slide>
                            <swiper-slide class="column__item">
                                <div class="voice">
                                    <div class="voice__inner">
                                        <div class="voice__user"><img class="voice__avatar" width="54" height="54" src="https://xy.qpic.cn/img/index/avatar/xs_zty.jpg" alt="张天仪">
                                            <div class="voice__info">
                                                <div class="voice__name">张天仪</div>
                                                <div class="voice__school">中央美术学院</div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <p class="voice__desc">高校美术大赛给了我一个很好的展示自我和提升自己的机会，感谢导师的指导，也希望学堂进一步越办越好呀！</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="voice">
                                    <div class="voice__inner">
                                        <div class="voice__user"><img class="voice__avatar" width="54" height="54" src="https://xy.qpic.cn/img/index/avatar/xs_zzf.jpg" alt="张梓峰">
                                            <div class="voice__info">
                                                <div class="voice__name">张梓峰</div>
                                                <div class="voice__school">中国美术学院</div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <p class="voice__desc">通过一系列的讲座，我学到了非常多的游戏设计内容,学堂给了我一个快速成长和接近游戏行业的机会。在了解行业设计流程和设计技能的提高上对我非常有帮助！祝腾讯游戏学堂越办越好，让更多的朋友能够步入自己心仪的游戏行业！</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="voice">
                                    <div class="voice__inner">
                                        <div class="voice__user"><img class="voice__avatar" width="54" height="54" src="https://xy.qpic.cn/img/index/avatar/xs_zly.jpg" alt="邹丽媛">
                                            <div class="voice__info">
                                                <div class="voice__name">邹丽媛</div>
                                                <div class="voice__school">重庆大学</div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <p class="voice__desc">感谢腾讯游戏学堂为我们提供优质专业的平台，游戏本就有着超越其娱乐精神的文化内涵，期待更多优秀的作品被发掘，期待更多的创造者被点亮。</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="voice">
                                    <div class="voice__inner">
