                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <p class="voice__desc">通过程序公开课，对于游戏研发过程有了深入的了解，感谢学堂让我们在踏入游戏行业前学习到这些知识。</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="voice">
                                    <div class="voice__inner">
                                        <div class="voice__user"><img class="voice__avatar" width="54" height="54" src="https://xy.qpic.cn/img/index/avatar/lzl.jpg" alt="李子龙">
                                            <div class="voice__info">
