                                                <div class="voice__school">上海交通大学</div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <p class="voice__desc">感谢腾讯游戏学堂，游戏改变世界，设计并开发出一款好的游戏是我的梦想！</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </swiper-slide>
                            <swiper-slide class="column__item">
                                <div class="voice">
                                    <div class="voice__inner">
                                        <div class="voice__user"><img class="voice__avatar" width="54" height="54" src="https://xy.qpic.cn/img/index/avatar/pyd.jpg" alt="蒲宇狄">
                                            <div class="voice__info">
