                                        <p class="voice__desc">首次系统化的走进游戏设计的神秘世界，更多的感受到一款游戏背后包含了怎样的艰辛与制作者注入的灵魂。</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="voice">
                                    <div class="voice__inner">
                                        <div class="voice__user"><img class="voice__avatar" width="54" height="54" src="https://xy.qpic.cn/img/index/avatar/xs_dxr.jpg" alt="狄心如">
                                            <div class="voice__info">
                                                <div class="voice__name">狄心如</div>
                                                <div class="voice__school">中国美术学院</div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <p class="voice__desc">在比赛过程中学习提升了很多，算是一次自我突破，同时也认识了很多非常优秀的朋友，是一次很丰富的体验，谢谢腾讯游戏学堂组织的美术大赛。</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="voice">
                                    <div class="voice__inner">
                                        <div class="voice__user"><img class="voice__avatar" width="54" height="54" src="https://xy.qpic.cn/img/index/avatar/xs_ggy.jpg" alt="郭共殷">
                                            <div class="voice__info">
                                                <div class="voice__name">郭共殷</div>
                                                <div class="voice__school">香港中文大学（深圳）</div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <p class="voice__desc">一年前的我们连要用什么软件做游戏，要怎么让一个人物动起来都不知道。作为财经类院校学生，想找到一个游戏开发指路人实在太难，有问题都不知道该去哪问。偶然间发现腾讯游戏学堂出品的各种视频、书籍和业内人士分享，发现了一个很好的比赛可以参加，帮我们在摸石头过河的道路上指引方向，无比感恩组委会！</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="voice">
                                    <div class="voice__inner">
                                        <div class="voice__user"><img class="voice__avatar" width="54" height="54" src="https://xy.qpic.cn/img/index/avatar/xs_xwt.jpg" alt="解温特">
                                            <div class="voice__info">
                                                <div class="voice__name">解温特</div>
                                                <div class="voice__school">南京大学</div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <p class="voice__desc">腾讯游戏学堂的程序公开课和游戏比赛都非常有意思，夏令营的几天时间让我对游戏从设计到落地有了更深的理解，周围的前辈们也非常nice。时间不长，但成长很多，希望游戏学堂可以越办越好！</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="voice">
                                    <div class="voice__inner">
                                        <div class="voice__user"><img class="voice__avatar" width="54" height="54" src="https://xy.qpic.cn/img/index/avatar/xs_ljq.jpg" alt="梁剑桥">
                                            <div class="voice__info">
                                                <div class="voice__name">梁剑桥</div>
                                                <div class="voice__school">浙江传媒学院</div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <p class="voice__desc">游戏不仅仅是纯粹的娱乐，我始终相信它可以作为伟大艺术的表达媒介，也希望人们能越来越正视游戏的力量。</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="voice">
                                    <div class="voice__inner">
                                        <div class="voice__user"><img class="voice__avatar" width="54" height="54" src="https://xy.qpic.cn/img/index/avatar/xs_lsc.jpg" alt="刘朔诚">
                                            <div class="voice__info">
                                                <div class="voice__name">刘朔诚</div>
                                                <div class="voice__school">中国传媒大学</div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <p class="voice__desc">腾讯游戏学堂给了我很多帮助 让我结识很多朋友之外也让我学习到了很多知识， 是一个刺激又有挑战的地方，谢谢腾讯游戏学堂。</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </swiper-slide>
                            <swiper-slide class="column__item">
                                <div class="voice">
                                    <div class="voice__inner">
                                        <div class="voice__user"><img class="voice__avatar" width="54" height="54" src="https://xy.qpic.cn/img/index/avatar/gx.jpg" alt="顾乡">
                                            <div class="voice__info">
                                                <div class="voice__name">顾乡</div>
                                                <div class="voice__school">清华大学</div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <p class="voice__desc">为我打开了游戏设计的大门，祝愿腾讯游戏学堂越办越好，让更多的游戏爱好者步入游戏制作的殿堂！</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="voice">
                                    <div class="voice__inner">
                                        <div class="voice__user"><img class="voice__avatar" width="54" height="54" src="https://xy.qpic.cn/img/index/avatar/ghx.jpg" alt="宫海翔">
                                            <div class="voice__info">
