                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <p class="voice__desc">短短几个月，通过腾讯游戏学堂导师悉心的辅导，让我对特效有了全新的理解，感谢学堂提供的学习平台和机会。</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="voice">
                                    <div class="voice__inner">
                                        <div class="voice__user"><img class="voice__avatar" width="54" height="54" src="https://xy.qpic.cn/img/index/avatar/yg.jpg" alt="杨刚">
                                            <div class="voice__info">
                                                <div class="voice__name">杨刚</div>
                                                <div class="voice__school">上海交通大学</div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <p class="voice__desc">通过系统的学习逐步了解到游戏程序的全貌，也对自己在游戏开发中所承担的角色有了更清楚的认识。</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="voice">
                                    <div class="voice__inner">
                                        <div class="voice__user"><img class="voice__avatar" width="54" height="54" src="https://xy.qpic.cn/img/index/avatar/zzp.jpg" alt="张智鹏">
                                            <div class="voice__info">
                                                <div class="voice__name">张智鹏</div>
                                                <div class="voice__school">复旦大学</div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <p class="voice__desc">腾讯游戏学堂的梦想校园行，让我首次系统化的走进游戏设计的神秘世界，让我对走进游戏制作行业多了一份期待。</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="voice">
                                    <div class="voice__inner">
                                        <div class="voice__user"><img class="voice__avatar" width="54" height="54" src="https://xy.qpic.cn/img/index/avatar/xs_wqt.jpg" alt="汪擎天">
                                            <div class="voice__info">
                                                <div class="voice__name">汪擎天</div>
                                                <div class="voice__school">中山大学</div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <p class="voice__desc">偶然接触到腾讯游戏学堂的项目，得以让我一窥游戏制作流程的全貌，更是我开启职业生涯前的一次重要体验，祝腾讯游戏学堂越办越好！</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                                <div class="voice">
                                    <div class="voice__inner">
                                        <div class="voice__user"><img class="voice__avatar" width="54" height="54" src="https://xy.qpic.cn/img/index/avatar/xs_wjt.jpg" alt="王灏天">
                                            <div class="voice__info">
                                                <div class="voice__name">王灏天</div>
                                                <div class="voice__school">电子科技大学</div>
                                            </div>
                                        </div>
                                        <p class="voice__desc">通过腾讯在我校开办的游戏设计与开发实践课程，我和小伙伴一起完整的体验了一款游戏从设计构思到动手开发再到上线运营的过程。这段经历让我在团队协作和游戏设计方面都有了快速的成长。</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
                            </swiper-slide>
                            <div class="swiper-pagination" slot="pagination"></div>
                        </swiper>
                    </div>
